   "text": "Finished #Carrie on Prime.\n\nIt\u2019s more of a reinterpretation than another adaptation and I appreciated that. I really enjoyed the series overall but felt the finale was a mixed bag, really could have done without that weird dance scene\n\nBut still looking forward to season 2",
